# Vantage — Project

PWA for real estate **360° virtual tours**. Agents upload equirectangular panoramas, place navigation hotspots, and share a public link. Buyers view for free; creators pay (Free / Pro $10 / Team $45).

## Stack (locked)

| Layer | Choice |
|---|---|
| App | Next.js App Router (`src/app`) |
| Host | Cloudflare Workers via `@opennextjs/cloudflare` |
| Images | Cloudflare R2 (`PANORAMAS` binding) |
| DB / Auth | Supabase Postgres + Auth (local via Docker + CLI; hosted for prod) |
| Viewer | Pannellum — engine to live in [ls-foundry](https://github.com/jeffgo10/ls-foundry) as `@jeffgo10/panorama-viewer` (local scaffold until published) |
| Payments | Stripe (Phase 3) |

**Related repos:** 360 engine in ls-foundry; product app here. **Never edit ls-foundry from this repo** — see `vantage-ls-foundry-boundary.mdc`.

Product planning lives in Obsidian `Vantage/` (Kickoff, Roadmap, Data Model, Pricing, Wireframes, Tech Stack).

## MVP scope reminder

Ship Free-tier **features** without Free-tier **limits**. Caps, watermarks, and billing turn on in Phase 3.

## Key routes

| Route | Role |
|---|---|
| `/dashboard` | Agent property list |
| `/properties/new`, `/properties/[id]/edit` | Create / tour editor |
| `/t/[slug]` | Public viewer (no login) |
| `/login`, `/signup` | Auth |

## Conventions

- Domain types: `src/types/`
- Supabase helpers: `src/lib/supabase/`
- Tier constants: `src/lib/constants.ts`
- Schema: `supabase/migrations/`
- Do not add `export const runtime = "edge"` — unsupported by OpenNext Cloudflare
- Prefer `pnpm` scripts: `dev`, `db:start` / `db:stop` / `db:reset`, `preview`, `deploy`, `cf-typegen`

